                <l xml:id="m-1a1d2950-57c3-4df9-98cc-e1d1ca985a31" facs="#m-4e5712c9-4d28-4054-a0f8-18826d06d3e4" label="text-like">7th Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-e0b90091-e89b-488b-bcea-bf3acadabd70" facs="#m-f9b04b11-a903-4ad7-b386-ec299408282f" label="ambiguous">iou</l><l xml:id="m-f6e05f15-dff3-452f-a01e-24449f5b6e01" facs="#m-febab477-8bd4-4a55-b86a-a9f18e7f0a69" label="lyrics-like">déntur.</l><l xml:id="m-ed17fc2a-d5a1-43aa-9c92-b437974fcec4" facs="#m-d777252f-53a0-4d7e-b926-b9e47adf3f37" label="ambiguous">4.</l><l xml:id="m-abc8a8d7-d5b0-4b91-91d4-17027dd68ac7" facs="#m-27be02b9-4a24-4e8d-9464-3d5cd319029b" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-9108b0ef-d82e-4b46-8815-e9c146936e34" facs="#m-f2f597f6-0480-4e7d-8f2f-9631d4959bff" label="lyrics-like">Lle-lú¬</l><l xml:id="m-d22e7275-f3ce-4126-81c4-bfc3cea138db" facs="#m-0f97dda6-0e03-4a67-9433-8ce8af447d6f" label="ambiguous">ia.</l><l xml:id="m-d03e27d9-9b96-492d-82d0-3c81b8c6ceae" facs="#m-290d2815-17df-4908-adc5-3267a911cd5e" label="lyrics-like">V. Omnes gén¬</l><l xml:id="m-cef0a8a9-d002-40c2-9db3-4a2020e64c7a" facs="#m-31c73e5f-7439-4fc0-a8c2-6bf3e42738bd" label="lyrics-like">pláu¬</l><l xml:id="m-fc009405-3787-42bd-8b4a-9e5cb754cb0f" facs="#m-63e0a2a9-0d52-4f58-9447-b9438c6adf2a" label="ambiguous">tes</l><l xml:id="m-5ed2fcb9-489c-45c8-b15e-614143168bab" facs="#m-80bd83d4-640b-4563-9334-c19c43623622" label="ambiguous">di¬</l><l xml:id="m-7bda213c-b871-401c-bef7-9f05868ba795" facs="#m-5882fc62-904a-4824-97c7-22cca836b021" label="lyrics-like">te má¬</l><l xml:id="m-7dc3edba-a86c-4e16-a7af-720228835e6b" facs="#m-b872e79b-f619-43a7-8b39-1e3140f74e07" label="lyrics-like">ju-bi-lá-te</l><l xml:id="m-e94ddb2d-67a1-494b-8f71-56ce0e2f4df5" facs="#m-7af8df50-3b72-44f8-bd7d-c91adde403b4" label="ambiguous">ni¬</l><l xml:id="m-9755d79c-6035-47f5-95b2-e9ff67a6568d" facs="#m-bff9c3e2-2a6a-4f9a-af38-32cf195c5f78" label="lyrics-like">Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-05f904fa-a41b-48e7-8e94-651c12465e54" facs="#m-d333d17e-274b-46ca-964f-14138f8ef549" label="ambiguous">bus:</l><l xml:id="m-084485ab-b0d1-40d8-951b-20066fc5696a" facs="#m-b2106fcb-5ca7-450d-9b77-6de400aa3756" label="lyrics-like">in vó¬</l><l xml:id="m-e2e76821-1ae7-49ed-9684-00999307847b" facs="#m-0a839dff-0f0e-4610-9a01-7f62199f009e" label="ambiguous">o</l><l xml:id="m-fc35965f-c519-44eb-8498-5c560c386062" facs="#m-ddfbb51f-0256-4f6b-89a9-16322ed6122e" label="ambiguous">exsulta- ti- 6-nis.</l><l xml:id="m-8083a1ef-da53-487b-b6df-ec06e5d81f2e" facs="#m-9b36766f-db96-4b85-9eb0-3415f00f53b7" label="ambiguous">ce</l><l xml:id="m-e2d838df-078a-49af-8190-af2190b681df" facs="#m-6899073f-a895-44b7-b798-6fea7d5ca26d" label="ambiguous">4 Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Matthaeum. Matth. 7. c.</l><l xml:id="m-1061748c-9ea7-4a8c-a29b-b6b8ec11cb3d" facs="#m-33855453-e15b-4f19-8c0f-1ceb158f4bad" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Dixit Jesus discí¬que arbor mala bonos fructus fá¬</l><l xml:id="m-7997f8db-cbdb-4cad-a8e1-3078d7d311a8" facs="#m-2e08193d-d051-4cc9-91f5-2d154a31a5d9" label="lyrics-like">L pulis suis: Atténdite a falsis pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-1de2a846-e5db-485f-bc64-39a00ec3a64d" facs="#m-c1c99505-bf4e-43eb-9b63-921aeea313d6" label="ambiguous">cere. Omnis arbor, quae non facit</l><l xml:id="m-7999e619-ab61-43b9-b6d4-8769546f82a4" facs="#m-3e09502f-0c26-4c7d-b640-70b91ea9ea38" label="lyrics-like">phétis, qui véniunt ad vos in vesti¬</l><l xml:id="m-db8e76e5-4ea1-48cd-a090-2f054b983cb1" facs="#m-1b4f385f-87ee-40c1-8d4a-5b9640043137" label="lyrics-like">fructum bonum, excidétur, et in</l><l xml:id="m-c06cf3ec-be04-42fb-9358-cc6ffce08802" facs="#m-488141d3-9686-4da9-8cee-2ccda99fb094" label="lyrics-like">ignem mittétur. Igitur ex frúctibus</l><l xml:id="m-a1546c45-9853-42b2-8e56-b66e8fc195f4" facs="#m-fe8a217d-4bd5-4d8c-ab57-419f76dd1f6c" label="lyrics-like">méntis óvium, intrínsecus autem</l><l xml:id="m-655bc788-3547-4132-b0f7-0fbaec28cf78" facs="#m-ffd9d22f-943c-48e0-84aa-13a3b3414ef3" label="lyrics-like">sunt lupi rapáces: a frúctibus eó¬</l><l xml:id="m-3a374b82-5e3a-498b-941d-1ea75cae80de" facs="#m-5453be98-5b0d-4f44-8d95-b3a88b3d6312" label="lyrics-like">córum cognoscétis eos. Non omnis,</l><l xml:id="m-7b0ff9e2-111f-41af-90e7-41b25fc624a1" facs="#m-583ac1ac-17f0-4e3e-acfe-9884834f37ed" label="lyrics-like">qui dicit mihi, Dómine. Dómine,</l><l xml:id="m-e6a20106-d0a8-444c-b077-a5cb41268f3b" facs="#m-6fad2407-203f-435b-9a07-7cf9a04ccd84" label="lyrics-like">rum cognoscétis eos. Numquid cól¬</l><l xml:id="m-c59e9361-3f92-4fd4-bf60-66dd36ab0dee" facs="#m-ba6f34c4-d98d-4d8a-9d0e-0dd6d47b39ba" label="lyrics-like">intrábit in regnum caelórum: sed</l><l xml:id="m-96f9179d-a650-4546-8cc7-2f64952bd240" facs="#m-3bb70476-cf21-41c0-a9f1-84adec5c2a3c" label="ambiguous">ligunt de spinis uvas, aut de tribu¬</l><l xml:id="m-96121b02-05c2-434b-8054-47797d8b88c5" facs="#m-72938bc5-4d92-4830-a939-fef4299e7b11" label="ambiguous">lis ficus? Sic omnis arbor bona fru¬</l><l xml:id="m-3d2631bc-f1b3-4aa2-a541-77cc3ef1e0e0" facs="#m-78967718-712c-4034-9763-dcb07df978d8" label="lyrics-like">qui facit voluntátem Patris mei, qui</l><l xml:id="m-2119ea2b-e191-4066-b586-1d3a6acc8498" facs="#m-ed0295d5-16fc-4162-bca8-762a38dbf4ea" label="lyrics-like">in caelis est, ipse intrábit in regnum</l><l xml:id="m-8c1f7762-d6ab-44b2-bc40-c5abf6bf9492" facs="#m-21ae40a2-6844-4e21-8bc3-04b2063ed403" label="ambiguous">ctus bonos facit : mala autem arbor</l><l xml:id="m-7bdbb3fe-b828-47e4-8801-71876cbe4c42" facs="#m-90ba51e2-89ff-4d3d-b21f-1d99e9f8820b" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-9e68090e-5331-4b6a-8ad1-fc4ac1c44d19" facs="#m-6c8482db-2e6a-4ec4-b44b-933401b85211" label="ambiguous">malos fructus facit. Non potest ar¬</l><l xml:id="m-e3b9fbb5-1a60-4586-89ae-c7ad3af7dbe7" facs="#m-4dc9ceb8-2aa8-42c5-8297-db84e8e1e3b1" label="lyrics-like">caelórum.</l><l xml:id="m-8bc052d8-fa12-48ec-b7f3-47492999581f" facs="#m-677ce525-e394-4cbc-82d7-0a4e0362fc4d" label="lyrics-like">bor bona malos fructus fácere: ne¬</l></lg>
            </div>
